OL,3,GNEWSA'Why I'm offering flats to
OL,4,Afirst-time buyers with 2.5% deposits'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sheffield developer will be among the
OL,7,Ffirst in England to offer low deposits
OL,8,Ffor new homeowners as part of a
OL,9,Fgovernment initiative.
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,12,Fannounced help for first-time buyers
OL,13,Fwith a new scheme that accepts deposits
OL,14,Fof 2.5%. There are also loans on offer
OL,15,Fwith 20% of the value of a newbuild
OL,16,Fproperty to help with the purchase.
OL,18,FDevelopment company Fortuna Terra said
OL,19,Ftheir new apartments on Commercial
OL,20,FStreet in Sheffield city centre would
OL,21,Fbe available via Your First Home.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
