OL,3,GNEWSA'Why I'm offering flats to
OL,4,Afirst-time buyers with 2.5% deposits'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe developer decided to take part as
OL,7,Fit found many prospective buyers were
OL,8,Frelying on parental help to raise a
OL,9,Fdeposit, despite their salaries being
OL,10,Fhigh enough to cover mortgage
OL,11,Frepayments.
